sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Seller
    participant B as Buyer
    participant AR as AssetRegistry
    participant SE as SaleEscrow
    participant RS as RoyaltySplitter
    participant LT as LicenceToken
    participant IPFS as IPFS

    Note over S,IPFS: Asset Registration
    S->>AR: list(hD, hC, R_D, R_C, cK, ..., price, royalty, parent)
    AR-->>S: assetId

    Note over B,LT: Purchase & Delivery
    B->>SE: buy(assetId) {value: price + bond}
    SE->>AR: get(assetId), isActive(assetId)
    S->>SE: deliver(saleId, encK)
    SE->>AR: isActive(assetId)

    Note over B,SE: Buyer Verification (off-chain)
    B->>IPFS: fetch C
    B->>B: verify H(C)=hC, decrypt K, verify H(D)=hD

    alt Honest
        B->>SE: confirm(saleId)
        SE->>RS: credit(seller, price-royalty)
        SE->>RS: credit(parent, royalty)
        SE->>LT: mint(buyer, assetId)
        SE-->>S: pay price
        SE-->>B: return bond
    else Dispute Mode 1
        B->>SE: disputeMode1(saleId, proof)
        SE->>SE: checkConsistency(R_D, R_C, cK, K, N, s, i, C_i, leafD, proofD, proofC)
        alt Consistent
            SE-->>S: pay price + buyer bond
            SE-->>B: slash buyer bond
        else Inconsistent
            SE-->>B: refund price + bond
            SE-->>B: slash seller bond
        end
    else Dispute Mode 2
        B->>SE: disputeMode2(saleId)
        S->>SE: respond(saleId, K, N, s)
        SE->>SE: verify cK
        SE-->>B: key revealed (content public)
        B->>SE: disputeMode1(saleId, proof)
    end

    Note over S,RS: Royalty Withdrawal
    S->>RS: withdraw()
    RS-->>S: transfer credit
    B->>RS: withdraw()
    RS-->>B: transfer credit
